OL,3,GNEWSACall to open delayed park's
OL,4,A'blocked off' walking trails
OL,5,
OL,6,FA conservation volunteer has called for
OL,7,Fa "blocked off" path along a delayed
OL,8,Fcity park to be opened so walking
OL,9,Froutes leading to a riverfront can be
OL,10,Faccessed.
OL,12,FRiverside Park, in Sunderland, was
OL,13,Fexpected to welcome visitors on 21
OL,14,FJuly, but dry weather postponed its
OL,15,Fopening and a new date is yet to be
OL,16,Fannounced.
OL,18,FJanice Timmins said fencing prevented
OL,19,Faccess to the riverfront and cut off
OL,20,Fparts of some walking routes, including
OL,21,Fthe Stephenson Trail.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
