OL,3,GNEWSACall to open delayed park's
OL,4,A'blocked off' walking trails
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Sunderland City Council said the
OL,7,Fpark was "a live construction site" and
OL,8,Fhad to remain closed for the safety of
OL,9,Fthe public until work had been fully
OL,10,Fcompleted.
